IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTPREFILL-V7.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-PAGES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-NUMA-SOCKETS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PAGE-CAPACITY-KB    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTPREFILL-V7.
    IF NUM-PAGES == 0 OR NUM-NUMA-SOCKETS == 0 OR PAGE-CAPACITY-KB == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 34400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
